---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CeCertificationCards from '../components/CeCertificationCards.jsx';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CE Marking & Technical Conformity Certification | Eurocert Asia"
  description="Comprehensive CE certification services ensuring your products meet all EU directives and standards for seamless market access across Europe."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/ce-certification/"
>
<section class="relative min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367850/eurocert/technical-conformity-ce-certification-make-an-imag.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover" alt="Technical conformity and CE certification hero banner for EU market compliance"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]/85"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-pulse"></div><div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-euro-500/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] animate-pulse" style="animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full h-full opacity-[0.02]" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0);background-size:50px 50px"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-32"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-2.5 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-eurogold-400/30 rounded-full mb-10"><div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/20 rounded-lg text-eurogold-400"><svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg></div><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">European Compliance</span></div><h1 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="heading-font text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-5 tracking-tight drop-shadow-lg">Technical <span className="inline-block" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e5be65 0%, #9cb1c9 50%, #708dcd 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; color: transparent; font-weight: 800;">Conformity</span></h1><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight drop-shadow-md">CE Certification</h2><div data-reveal="reveal-scale" data-reveal-delay="300" class="w-40 h-1 mx-auto mb-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-eurogold-400 via-eurogold-300 to-euro-400"></div><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="400" class="text-white/80 text-base md:text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed drop-shadow-sm">Comprehensive CE certification services ensuring your products meet all EU directives and standards for seamless market access across Europe</p><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="500" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-10"><a class="px-8 py-4 text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #D4A843 0%, #0a2463 100%)" href="/contact/#contact-form">Get Certified</a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="px-8 py-4 border border-white/40 text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300">Call Now</a></div></div></section>

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-left" class="space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4">Technical Conformity</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">CE Certification</h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">CE marking is the mandatory conformity marking for products sold within the European Economic Area (EEA). It demonstrates that your products meet EU safety, health, and environmental protection requirements.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed">At <strong class="text-slate-900">Eurocert Asia</strong>, our expert team guides you through the entire certification process, ensuring full compliance with all relevant EU directives and standards.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Expert Guidance</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Industry-certified professionals</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Directive Compliance</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Full EU standards adherence</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Fast-track Audit</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Quick certification process</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-earth-americas"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Global Market Support</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Worldwide recognition</p></div></div></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="relative"><div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-eurogold-400/10 border border-slate-100 h-[450px] lg:h-[550px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367707/eurocert/Gemini_Generated_Image_doy2sldoy2sldoy2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE certified product compliance visual for European directives"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/90 to-transparent"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div><h4 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-1">Certified Excellence</h4><p class="text-white/60 text-sm">1000+ certifications delivered</p></div><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/20 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/30"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-24 h-24 bg-euro-600 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse"><span class="text-white text-3xl font-bold">CE</span></div></div></div></div></section>

<CeCertificationCards client:visible />

<section class="relative py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-euro-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-xs text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4">Additional Services</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Specialized Standards</h2><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="text-slate-500 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">Advanced certifications for welding, structural, and specialized components</p></div><div class="flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto pb-4 snap-x scrollbar-hide"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="0" class="flex-shrink-0 w-80 p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 snap-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-2xl mb-5"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-600 text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">EN 15085 Railway Welding</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fusion welding certification for railway vehicles and components.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="flex-shrink-0 w-80 p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 snap-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-2xl mb-5"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-600 text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">EN 1090 Structural</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">CE marking for structural steel and aluminum fabrications.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="flex-shrink-0 w-80 p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 snap-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-2xl mb-5"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-600 text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 3834 Fusion Quality</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Quality requirements for fusion welding of metallic materials.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="300" class="flex-shrink-0 w-80 p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 snap-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-2xl mb-5"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-600 text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">EN 1997 Geotechnical</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Geotechnical design and ground investigation standards.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="400" class="flex-shrink-0 w-80 p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 snap-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-2xl mb-5"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-600 text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">EN 1090 Execution</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Execution classes for steel and aluminum structures.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#030a16] relative overflow-hidden text-white">
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[#d8ad4c]/5 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h4 class="heading-font text-xs text-[#d8ad4c] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-3">Our Advantage</h4>
      <h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose <span class="text-[#d8ad4c]">Eurocert</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="text-center p-8 bg-[#061226] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:border-[#d8ad4c]/50 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(216,173,76,0.15)] transition-all duration-500 group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#d8ad4c]/15 border border-[#d8ad4c]/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16] transition-all duration-300">
          <i class="fas fa-user-tie text-2xl text-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16]"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Expert Team</h4>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">15+ years of industry experience</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-8 bg-[#061226] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:border-[#d8ad4c]/50 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(216,173,76,0.15)] transition-all duration-500 group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#d8ad4c]/15 border border-[#d8ad4c]/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16] transition-all duration-300">
          <i class="fas fa-rocket text-2xl text-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16]"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Fast Processing</h4>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Quick market entry</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-8 bg-[#061226] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:border-[#d8ad4c]/50 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(216,173,76,0.15)] transition-all duration-500 group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#d8ad4c]/15 border border-[#d8ad4c]/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16] transition-all duration-300">
          <i class="fas fa-globe-americas text-2xl text-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16]"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Global Recognition</h4>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">International certifications</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-8 bg-[#061226] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:border-[#d8ad4c]/50 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(216,173,76,0.15)] transition-all duration-500 group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#d8ad4c]/15 border border-[#d8ad4c]/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16] transition-all duration-300">
          <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart text-2xl text-[#d8ad4c] group-hover:text-[#030a16]"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Full Support</h4>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">End-to-end assistance</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden bg-white"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-eurogold-50/40 via-transparent to-euro-100/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, #D4A843 1px, transparent 0);background-size:40px 40px"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center p-12 lg:p-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-white backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-100 rounded-[3rem]"><h4 class="heading-font text-xs text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4">Ready to Begin</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">Start Your CE Certification Today</h2><p class="text-slate-500 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Contact our experts to begin your journey to European market access with comprehensive CE certification support.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-10 py-5 text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #D4A843 0%, #0a2463 100%)" href="/contact/#contact-form">Get Started</a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-10 py-5 border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-2xl hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all duration-300">Call Now</a></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
